Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add Sparse Merkle Tree and incremental UTXO state
 machinery

Add the 256-bit Sparse Merkle Tree (SmtNode) and incremental UTXO state
transition primitives.

Original-Commit: ce737ccdcee403a0bf95611e9890a910852e07c9
Original-Patch: v2/007
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

(cherry picked from commit 5a512b0bd7268f04829f03ec51ac321c009442de)

